<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasCharacterization1> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasConditionData> ;
                                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasCharacterization2
<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasCharacterization2> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasConditionData> ;
                                                            rdfs:range xsd:string .


