<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPipeSectionConditionStation> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                                      rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPipeSectionConditionData> ;
                                                                      rdfs:range xsd:float .


###  https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPositionFrom
<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPositionFrom> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                       rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasConditionData> ;
                                                       rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPositionTo
<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasPositionTo> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                     rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasConditionData> ;
                                                     rdfs:range xsd:string .


