<https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasQuantification1> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                          rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto#hasConditionData> ;
                                                          rdfs:range xsd:float .


