###  http://www.semanticweb.org/jluis/ontologies/sdco#Location
:Location rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf :Observation ;
          rdfs:comment """Made for BBH Vermin: Describes the location of the vermin.

The location of the vermin: 
 in the pipeline (A);
 in a connection (B);
 in an open joint (C);
 !other (Z) – where this is used further details shall be recorded in the remarks section.\"

Has potential to be used to also describe other damage codes with more detail.""" .


