#################################################################
#    Annotations
#################################################################

:Angular rdfs:comment "Used by BAJ Displaced Joint" .


:Break rdfs:comment "pieces of pipe visibly displaced but not missing" .


:CollapsedBreakOrCollapse rdfs:comment "complete loss of structural integrity" .


:LossOfVision rdfs:comment "Reasons for loss of vision captured in subclass 'Cause'" .


:MissingWallBreakOrCollapse rdfs:comment "missing pieces of wall" .


:OtherCause rdfs:comment "General catch all for any other cause / obstructions described in several damage codes." .


:OtherObservation rdfs:comment "Describes the codes categorized as 'Other' in DIN EN 13508-2." .


:Radial rdfs:comment "used by BAJ Displaced Joint" .


